WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.060
This is a message from CDC.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.520
I'm Dr. Fernando Stein, President of the American Academy

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.340
of Pediatrics. Flood water may contain sewage or chemicals.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.120
Wash hands for at least 20 seconds with soap

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:16.020
and clean water after touching floodwaters, using the toilet,

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.920
and before preparing or eating food.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.120
Do not let children play in floodwaters or take

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.520
part in disaster cleanup.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.000
Some toys can be disinfected.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.780
When in doubt, throw them out.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.250
To learn more, call 1-800-CDC-INFO.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.020
This is a message from the American Academy of

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:30.020
Pediatrics.
